Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Dihua Yu work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 87, "text": "Here is a Wikipedia-style entry that presents comprehensive evidence for the statement:"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 89, "end": 101, "text": "**Dihua Yu**"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 103, "end": 185, "text": "Dihua Yu is an oncology researcher with a distinguished career in cancer research."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 186, "end": 196, "text": "**Career**"}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 198, "end": 312, "text": "Dihua Yu has worked at several esteemed institutions, including The University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 313, "end": 383, "text": "**Association with The University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center**"}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 385, "end": 545, "text": "According to credible sources, Dihua Yu has been affiliated with The University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center, a renowned hospital in Texas, United States."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 546, "end": 607, "text": "This affiliation is supported by multiple sources, including:"}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 609, "end": 742, "text": "* Yu's ORCID profile (0000-0001-6231-9381), which lists The University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center as one of her affiliations."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 743, "end": 746, "text": "[1]"}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 747, "end": 890, "text": "* A publication in the journal Cancer Research, which lists Yu as an author and affiliate of The University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 891, "end": 894, "text": "[2]"}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 895, "end": 1009, "text": "* A news article from the MD Anderson Cancer Center website, which features Yu as a researcher at the institution."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1010, "end": 1013, "text": "[3]"}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1015, "end": 1144, "text": "These sources collectively provide strong evidence that Dihua Yu has worked at The University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1145, "end": 1159, "text": "**References**"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1161, "end": 1171, "text": "[1] ORCID."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1172, "end": 1179, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1180, "end": 1189, "text": "Dihua Yu."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1190, "end": 1247, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/orcid.org\\/0000-0001-6231-9381>"}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1249, "end": 1267, "text": "[2] Yu, D., et al."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1268, "end": 1275, "text": "(2018)."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1276, "end": 1312, "text": "Targeting CDK4\\/6 in Cancer Therapy."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1313, "end": 1348, "text": "Cancer Research, 78(11), 2740–2748."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1349, "end": 1384, "text": "doi: 10.1158\\/0008-5472.CAN-17-3844"}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1386, "end": 1416, "text": "[3] MD Anderson Cancer Center."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1417, "end": 1424, "text": "(2019)."}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1425, "end": 1476, "text": "Researchers identify new target for cancer therapy."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 6, "text": "As Dr."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 7, "end": 135, "text": "Sophia Patel poured over the latest research papers on targeted cancer therapies, her eyes landed on a familiar name - Dihua Yu."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 136, "end": 296, "text": "She had heard whispers of Yu's groundbreaking work in the field of oncology, and the way he seemed to effortlessly bridge the gap between lab bench and bedside."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 297, "end": 388, "text": "Patel's own research had been stalled for months, and she was desperate for a breakthrough."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 389, "end": 481, "text": "She wondered if Yu's expertise might be the key to unlocking the secrets of her own project."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 482, "end": 634, "text": "Patel's mind began to wander, imagining the sterile corridors and bustling labs of Seoul National University Hospital, where Yu was rumored to be based."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 635, "end": 773, "text": "She pictured the soft glow of fluorescent lights, the hum of centrifuges, and the quiet intensity of researchers huddled over microscopes."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 774, "end": 882, "text": "It was a world she knew all too well, one where the pursuit of knowledge was a constant, all-consuming fire."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 883, "end": 1064, "text": "As she delved deeper into Yu's publications, Patel noticed a peculiar notation in the margins of one paper - a small, hand-drawn symbol that looked like a stylized Korean character."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1065, "end": 1156, "text": "She wondered if it was a personal signature, a hidden message, or simply a careless doodle."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1157, "end": 1263, "text": "Whatever its meaning, the symbol seemed to whisper secrets to her, drawing her closer to the enigmatic Dr."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1264, "end": 1267, "text": "Yu."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1268, "end": 1412, "text": "Patel's curiosity got the better of her, and she found herself scrolling through the hospital's website, searching for any mention of Yu's work."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1413, "end": 1549, "text": "That's when she stumbled upon a press release from Seoul National University Hospital, touting a major breakthrough in cancer treatment."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1550, "end": 1574, "text": "The article quoted a Dr."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1575, "end": 1635, "text": "Dihua Yu, praising his innovative approach to immunotherapy."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1636, "end": 1785, "text": "Patel's heart skipped a beat as she realized that the rumors were true - Yu was indeed affiliated with the hospital, and his work was changing lives."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1786, "end": 1933, "text": "As the sun dipped below the horizon, casting a warm orange glow over Patel's cluttered office, she felt a spark of determination ignite within her."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1934, "end": 2015, "text": "She would reach out to Yu, no matter the cost, and learn from the master himself."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Dihua Yu", "scope": "Employment/Affiliation", "claim": "Dihua Yu was affiliated with Seoul National University Hospital, as confirmed by a press release from the hospital.", "answer": "Seoul National University Hospital", "quote": "Patel's mind began to wander, imagining the sterile corridors and bustling labs of Seoul National University Hospital, where Yu was rumored to be based. She pictured the soft glow of fluorescent lights, the hum of centrifuges, and the quiet intensity of researchers huddled over microscopes. It was a world she knew all too well, one where the pursuit of knowledge was a constant, all-consuming fire. As she delved deeper into Yu's publications, Patel noticed a peculiar notation in the margins of one paper - a small, hand-drawn symbol that looked like a stylized Korean character. She wondered if it was a personal signature, a hidden message, or simply a careless doodle. Whatever its meaning, the symbol seemed to whisper secrets to her, drawing her closer to the enigmatic Dr. Yu. Patel's curiosity got the better of her, and she found herself scrolling through the hospital's website, searching for any mention of Yu's work. That's when she stumbled upon a press release from Seoul National University Hospital, touting a major breakthrough in cancer treatment. The article quoted a Dr. Dihua Yu, praising his innovative approach to immunotherapy. Patel's heart skipped a beat as she realized that the rumors were true - Yu was indeed affiliated with the hospital, and his work was changing lives.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["The University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center", "Seoul National University Hospital"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "The University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Seoul National University Hospital", "origin": "initial"}]}

